[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/163172579","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/126#issuecomment-163172579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/126","id":163172579,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2MzE3MjU3OQ==","user":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-01-02T18:37:23Z","updated_at":"2015-12-09T10:09:14Z","body":"_Original comment by_ **Claudiu Popa (BitBucket: [PCManticore](http://bitbucket.org/PCManticore), GitHub: @PCManticore)**:\n\n---\n\nI wasn't aware of `__all__` and submodules either, nice.\nI don't believe it's that hard to fix this, for instance, here's a `naive` fix as a unified diff.\nIt's not properly tested, but for normal packages it seems to work, although I'll wait for Sylvain to give his opinion about this.\n\nNote that it doesn't support subpackages (made only to demonstrate that it's possible to fix relatively easy).\n\n```\n#!python\n\ndiff -r 07c78f08c5eb checkers/variables.py\n--- a/checkers/variables.py Mon Dec 30 08:32:19 2013 +0200\n+++ b/checkers/variables.py Thu Jan 02 20:34:07 2014 +0200\n@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@\n \"\"\"\n\n import sys\n+import os\n from copy import copy\n\n import astroid\n@@ -217,7 +218,20 @@\n                         del not_consumed[elt_name]\n                         continue\n                     if elt_name not in node.locals:\n-                        self.add_message('E0603', args=elt_name, node=elt)\n+                        # check to see if we are in a package\n+                        if not node.package:\n+                            self.add_message('E0603', args=elt_name, node=elt)\n+                        else:\n+                            basename = os.path.splitext(node.file)[0]\n+                            if os.path.basename(basename) == '__init__':\n+                                path = os.path.dirname(node.path)\n+                                elt_path = os.path.join(path, elt_name)\n+                                for ext in ('.py', '.pyc', '.pyo'):\n+                                    if os.path.exists(elt_path + ext):\n+                                        break\n+                                else:\n+                                    self.add_message('E0603', args=elt_name,\n+                                                     node=elt)\n         # don't check unused imports in __init__ files\n         if not self.config.init_import and node.package:\n             return\n\n\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/163172579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://a